{
  "id": "ROM.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Romawa 5",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Buɗaɗɗen Littafi Mai Tsarki, Sabon Rai Don Kowa™ Neman RubutaccenIzini © 2009, 2020 ta hannun Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Hausa Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 2009, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" wani tambarin ne da aka yi wa rajista a ofishi Lamba Ƙerar da Tambari a Amurka ta hannun Biblica, Inc. Wanda aka yi amfani ta wurin samun izini. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Salama da farin ciki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, da yake an same mu marasa laifi ta wurin bangaskiya, muna",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "da salama tare da Allah ta wurin Ubangijinmu Yesu Kiristi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta wurinsa ne muka sami shiga wannan alherin da muke tsaye yanzu, ta wurin bangaskiya. Muna kuma",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "farin ciki a begen ɗaukakar Allah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba haka kawai ba, amma muna",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "kuma da farin ciki cikin shan wuyanmu, gama mun san cewa shan wuyan nan takan haifi jimiri;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jimiri kuma yakan kawo hali mai kyau; hali mai kyau kuma yakan sa bege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bege kuwa ba ya ba mu kunya, domin Allah ya zuba ƙaunarsa a zukatanmu ta wurin Ruhu Mai Tsarkin da ya ba mu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kun ga, a daidai lokaci, yayinda muke marasa ƙarfi, Kiristi ya mutu saboda waɗanda ba su san Allah ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Da ƙyar wani yă mutu saboda mai adalci, ko da yake saboda mutumin kirki wani zai iya ƙarfin hali yă mutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma Allah ya nuna mana ƙaunarsa a wannan. Tun muna masu zunubi tukuna, Kiristi ya mutu dominmu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Da yake yanzu mun sami zama marasa laifi ta wurin jininsa, ashe kuwa za a cece mu daga fushin Allah ta wurinsa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama in kuwa, sa'ad da muke abokan gāban Allah, aka sulhunta mu da shi ta wurin mutuwar Ɗansa, ashe, da yake an sulhunta mu, za mu sami ceto ta wurin ransa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba ma haka yake kawai ba, har muna farin ciki da Allah ta wurin Ubangijinmu Yesu Kiristi, wanda ta wurinsa yanzu muka sami sulhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mutuwa ta wurin Adamu, rai ta wurin Kiristi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, kamar yadda zunubi ya shigo duniya ta wurin mutum ɗaya, mutuwa kuma ta wurin zunubi, ta haka kuwa mutuwa ta shafi dukan mutane, domin dukan mutane sun yi zunubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama kafin a ba da doka, zunubi yana nan a duniya. Amma ba a lissafin zunubi inda babu doka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duk da haka, mutuwa ta yi mulki tun Adamu har yă zuwa Musa, ta yi mulki har ma a kan waɗanda ba su yi zunubi ta wurin taka umarni kamar yadda Adamu ya yi ba. A wata hanya dai Adamu shi ne kwatancin wani mutumin nan mai zuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma kyautan nan dabam take da laifin nan. Gama in mutane da yawa sun mutu saboda laifin mutum ɗayan nan, to, ai, alherin Allah da kuma kyautan nan mai zuwa ta wurin alherin mutum ɗayan nan, Yesu Kiristi, ya shafi mutane da yawa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyautar Allah kuwa ba kamar sakamakon da ya bi zunubin mutum gudan nan ba ne, Hukuncin ya bi zunubin mutum gudan nan, ya kuma kawo hallaka, amma kyautar ta bi laifofin masu yawa ta kuma sa Allah ya gan mu a matsayin marasa laifi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama in, ta wurin laifin mutum ɗaya, mutuwa ta yi mulki ta wurin mutum ɗayan nan, ashe, waɗanda suka sami kyautar alherin Allah a yalwace da kuma kyautar adalci za su yi mulki a wannan rayuwa ta wurin mutum ɗayan nan, Yesu Kiristi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, kamar yadda sakamakon laifin mutum guda ya jawo hallaka ga dukan mutane, haka ma sakamakon aikin adalci guda ya sa Allah ya same mu marasa laifi, wannan kuwa kawo rai ga dukan mutane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama kamar yadda ta wurin rashin biyayyar mutum guda, mutane masu yawa suka zama masu zunubi, haka kuma ta wurin biyayyar mutum guda, mutane da yawa za su zama masu adalci.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An ba da dokar don mu ga yadda laifi yake da girma. Amma da zunubi ya ƙaru, sai alheri ya ƙaru sosai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "domin, kamar yadda zunubi ya yi mulki cikin mutuwa, haka ma alheri yă yi mulki ta wurin adalci yă kuwa kawo rai madawwami ta wurin Yesu Kiristi Ubangijinmu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ROM.6",
    "number": "6",
    "bookId": "ROM"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ROM.4",
    "number": "4",
